      "title": "Elementary transformations & Inverse by elementary row/column ops",
      "page": 36,
      "inShort": "Three elementary transformations: R_i ↔ R_j, R_i → k R_i (k≠0), R_i → R_i + k R_j. To find A⁻¹ by row transformations, start with A · A⁻¹ = I and reduce A to I.",
      "sections": [
